 "description": "Use this tool for questions about a named judge's courtroom presentation or practice rules, including PowerPoint, video, demonstratives, advance exchange, exhibits, or courtroom technology. Resolve the judge's canonical profile URL with find_judges when needed, then answer from these findings and underlying source links. Federal/national, statewide, and courtwide findings are broader rules, not personal preferences; if judge-specific findings are absent, state that limit without looking up court metadata or a judge roster unless the user asks for them. Up to 10 optional topics narrow the findings; missing findings do not establish permission.",
